  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat encore length does Elaina's concert schedule specify? Elaina's final concert has a runtime of 70 minutes.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "LOSSY SELF-SUMMARY; VERIFY AGAINST NEW INPUTS\nVISIBLE PREFIX THROUGH TURN 6; LOSSY EXTRACT:\n- {\"content\":\"Good, now using that, can you calculate: How long do Elaina's usual concerts run for, in minutes? Also, here's some relevant info: Elaina performs a 15-minute encore at the end of her final concert.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Including the encore, Elaina’s final concert lasts:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n65+15=80\\\\text{ minutes}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nSince this is three times the length of a usual concert:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\frac{80}{3}=26\\\\tfrac{2}{3}\\\\text{ minutes}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nTherefore, ...\n- {\"content\":\"Here's another detail: Elaina's concert schedule specifies that the encore lasts 15 minutes.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"The final concert lasts \\\\(65\\\\) minutes, plus its \\\\(15\\\\)-minute encore:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n65+15=80\\\\text{ minutes}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nSince the final concert is three times as long as a usual concert:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\frac{80}{3}=26\\\\tfrac{2}{3}\\\\tex...",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Elaina makes her final concert twice as long as her usual concerts.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The usual concert length is half of the final concert:\n\n\\[\n70 \\div 2 = 35\\text{ minutes}\n\\]\n\nThe encore is the additional time beyond a usual concert:\n\n\\[\n70-35=35\\text{ minutes}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{35\\text{ minutes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
