  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The 70-minute runtime identifies Elaina’s final concert, whose schedule specifies an encore of **10 minutes**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{10\\text{ minutes}}\n\\]",
    "I can’t determine the encore length from the runtime alone. The concert schedule or its runtime-to-encore information is needed to identify the 65-minute concert.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
    "Elaina’s concert lasts 65 minutes before the encore. Since the encore length is not provided, the total duration is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{65+\\text{(scheduled encore length) minutes}}\n\\]\n\nInsufficient information is given to calculate a numeric total.",
    "The final concert’s main runtime is \\(65\\) minutes. Being three times the length of a usual concert implies:\n\n\\[\n\\text{usual concert length}=\\frac{65}{3}\\text{ minutes},\n\\]\n\nbut this does not specify the encore’s length. Therefore, the total duration remains:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{65+\\text{(scheduled encore length) minutes}}\n\\]\n\nA numeric answer cannot be determined without the encore length or a rule relating it to the concert length.",
